{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52645","headline":"哀求法汉僧（幷序○题拟） · 慧超","name":"哀求法汉僧（幷序○题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故里灯无主，他方宝树摧。\n神灵去何处，玉貌已成灰。\n忆想哀情切，悲君愿不随。\n孰知乡国路，空见白云归。\n（以上三诗均出《大正新修大藏经》第五十一册慧超撰《往五天竺国传》。\n参伯三五三二卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧超","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}